{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06916","headline":"鄂渚招王昌龄张偾 · 常建","name":"鄂渚招王昌龄张偾","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"刈芦旷野中，沙土飞黄云。\n天晦无精光，茫茫悲远君。\n楚山隔湘水，湖畔落日曛。\n春鴈又北飞，音书固难闻。\n谪居未爲叹，谗枉何由分。\n午日逐蛟龙，宜爲吊冤文。\n翻覆古共然，名宦安足云。\n贫士任枯槁，捕鱼清江濆。\n有时荷鉏犂，旷野自耕耘。\n不然春山隐，溪涧花氤氲。\n山鹿自有场，贤达亦顾羣。\n二贤归去来，世上徒纷纷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"常建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06916.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06916","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}